# Local secrets for `wrangler dev` (体验版 / trial). Copy to `.dev.vars` and fill
# in. `.dev.vars` is gitignored — never commit real values. In production these
# are set with `wrangler secret put <NAME>` instead.

# The real xAI key. Only ever used on the Worker→xAI upstream leg.
XAI_API_KEY="xai-REPLACE_ME"

# 体验模式通过本地 Auth Worker 的登录账户换取短期票据。
